Z||000003||Cooter||07-18-2000||09:07 PM||||Wait a minute! How did you get Bob's car? <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/outside_2.jpg"> <P>Red sure looks good on a Fiero!||||reg||1
