Z||000022||mrfixit58||07-20-2000||02:18 PM||||87GT,<P>Yes, my Bro-n-Law is in Florida. He in Oldsmar, west of the Tampa International Airport. The guy who painted it is in Clearwater/St Pete I think. If you really want to know, send me a personal e-mail and I'll forward your request to my Bro-n-Law when he gets back from vacation. I'm sure he would be happy to give you the name of the shop. Be aware, it took the guy two months to fully dis-assemble the car, paint it, then re-assemble and align. He sure does nice work, though.<P>Roy  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||10
