Z||000024||b lo 0||07-21-2000||11:28 AM||||Great job!!  That really boosted my mood after seeing those rotting '89s.  I'll be sure to post some before and after pics of my '85-it's about the same condition, but I'm going custom on mine.  Picked out the Mr. Mikes two tone seat leathers (great stuff!) and ASA JS5 five spoke wheels-they compliment  the lines of a Notchback great!!  I also picked out a 16" tall touring spoiler from Erebuni-makes it look like a race car.  My design firm Catalyst Concepts at <A HREF="http://www.angelfire.com/ny3/cc" TARGET=_blank>http://www.angelfire.com/ny3/cc</A>  drew up this concept pic, although this car has the coupe bodywork, and my car will be white with frost blue racing stripes.  I'll keep yall updated!!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.angelfire.com/ga3/audioimagery/fierocustom1.gif"> <P>------------------<BR>'85 GT (in progress)  <BR>titled ICE-plates B LO 0 <BR>GAWD I love this car||||reg||10
